Network Scanning with Zenmap
Background
Zenmap is the official GUI version of Nmap, a free and open source security scanner used by cybersecurity professionals and ethical hackers. It runs on multiple platforms (Linux, Windows, Mac OS X, BSD) and makes Nmap easier for beginners while offering advanced features for experienced users. Frequently used scans can be saved as profiles for repeated execution.
