Why This Matters
1.	Network Visibility → Identifying your IP and subnet defines the scope of your LAN scan.
2.	Attack Surface Mapping → Knowing the subnet (/24) allows scanning all 254 possible hosts.
3.	Defensive Awareness → Helps administrators monitor devices and detect unauthorized connections.
