3.	Defensive Awareness → Administrators can monitor these hosts and secure exposed services.
🎓 Learning Outcome
This project demonstrates how Zenmap/Nmap can identify live hosts, IP addresses, and MAC addresses in a subnet. In this case, 5 hosts were active in the 192.168.100.0/24 range. This provides the foundation for deeper analysis of open ports, services, and vulnerabilities in subsequent tasks.
